      "message": "docs(process): review-prs posts an estimated token cost when a PR turns merge-ready\n\nNew step 2c in the review-prs skill: when a review ends merge-ready, the\ndispatcher posts one comment (marker <!-- review-cost: <sha> -->) with\nthe estimated agent cost of getting that PR there - every dispatched run\non the PR (reviews, re-reviews, conflict/replacement agents, fix agents),\ntokens from each completion notification, priced at a blended upper\nestimate (90 % input / 10 % output at list price: Opus 5.5 ~$5.60/M,\nSonnet 5.5 ~$2.80/M, Haiku 5.5 ~$0.14/M). Main-session turns aren't\ncounted, and the comment says so.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
